        "question": "What is the midpoint of the line segment joining (2, 4) and (6, 8)?",
        "options": [
          "A) (4, 6)",
          "B) (3, 5)",
          "C) (8, 12)",
          "D) (4, 4)"
        ],
        "correct": "A",
        "explanation": "Midpoint = ((x1+x2)/2, (y1+y2)/2) = ((2+6)/2, (4+8)/2) = (4, 6)."
